WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:03.650
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.820
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:11.320
Okay, babies.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:14.070
This is the start of the second semester.

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:15.200
Right!

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:21.330
I've brought some big news in recognition of you all making it to the second stage. {stage not used like it usually is for once}{I think it actually is, just metaphorically in a way that matches the metaphorical english version (cf. "to be next stage" etc.)}

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.000
Big news?

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.330
And what would that be?

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:28.340
CDs!{bitte}

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:32.130
It's finally time for your CD debut!

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.940
You all sparkle like CDs.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:20.030
However, it will not be all of you.

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:23.950
How's it flowing?{disregarding the apostrophe placement on y'all, why of all people did you him this?}{I literally don't even remember doing so}

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:27.250
I'm Sashita from Four Star Label! {there are in fact english labels called something label, but even I know that 'records' is more common. I'm not opposed to changing it if you're against it}

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:30.370
Four Star Label?

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:31.960
The super famous one?{yume est}

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:37.220
It is the exclusive label of Four Star Academy, covering our idols only.

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:41.970
Sashida-shi is a capable producer who also overlooks S4. {even I'm cringing at my own use of shi}{you have every right of bend the rules}

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:46.720
Yeah, yeah, yeah. Moroboshi-chan, you flatter me.

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:53.230
So anyways, every fall we pick a New Princess from Song Class

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:56.860
and make her a debut CD to put on sale.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.610
Last year, it was Ashida Yuri.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:00.740
And the year before that...

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:02.870
It was Hime-senpai, right?

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:08.870
Now that you know, be ready for the audition in three days.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:10.250
Huh?

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:11.620
What was that?

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.130
Three days.

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.630
Wow! A CD debut?

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:25.180
Yeah, but you have to pass an audition first.

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:27.220
I won't lose.

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:29.480
Neither will I!

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:34.150
<i>Yume-chan and Rola are at each other's throats.</i>

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.940
Those fries look delicious.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:37.900
Want one?

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.110
So good!

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:42.860
Huh?

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:44.030
What is it?

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:46.780
Nothing. I'm just relieved.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:51.620
I thought you'd be more on edge about who'd get the CD debut.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:54.580
That's that, and this is this. {I... I'm pretty sure this is english}{I don't think it is but it's... fine?}

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:57.300
No hard feelings no matter who wins!

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.210
Come on, we should get going.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.380
Sure! It's training time!

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:04.180
Bye Koharu-chan, see you later.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:05.050
Sure.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:06.890
Wait for me, geez.

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.810
<i>Those two are perfect rivals.</i>

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:08.890
You're too slow.

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:14.150
A mountain?!

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:17.650
Babies, you'll be wearing these for today's lesson.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:21.150
It's still hot out, and you're making us wear scarves and coats?

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:25.820
I get it! It's gonna refresh us by making us sweat!

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:30.660
I-It's heavy.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:32.660
Wh-What is this?

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:34.250
Forget about wearing it...

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.670
I can't even pick it up!

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:41.920
That goes without saying. The whole getup adds to thirty kilograms.

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.970
Th-Thirty kilograms?!{tl note: 30 kg is 4.7 stone}

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:46.220
That's how much I weigh!

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:49.430
What is it?

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:52.680
How are we supposed to have a lesson in these if we can't even walk?

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:54.560
Let me tell you something about those.

00:04:54.890 --> 00:05:00.690
Shiratori Hime once ran 42.195 kilometers while donning it.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:12.370
That's incredible.

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:14.960
That gets me going. I'll do it!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:16.330
M-Me too!

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:19.500
Okay, now you're raring to go.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:27.590
The Aikatsu girl fell... down! {I just did this in amanchu and did red light green light, but Anna makes a joke...}

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:33.850
Do I spy anyone moving?

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:37.690
<i>Having to hold still with this weight...</i>

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:40.230
<i>This is really tough!</i>

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:42.360
Okay, next round!

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:48.570
The Aikatsu girl... fell down!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:52.120
I-I can't!

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.620
I'm finished!

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:57.620
That's two Aikatsu girls who fell down!

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:59.290
You two are out!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.130
What?

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:05.880
No matter what outfit you're in, 
you need to be able to strike a pose.

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:10.140
Again, from the start!

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:13.760
Are you sure about letting them all go on like that, Moroboshi-chan?

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:18.770
New Princess is one of Four Star Label's spotlight plans.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.860
Attract the most attention possible.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:23.520
Yeah, yeah, yeah, but still.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:32.070
Now you just got all the others fired up over nothing.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.780
It's the only way.

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:36.830
Dreams and failure are two sides of the same coin.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:39.170
Where one goes, the other must follow.

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:41.080
One, two!

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.380
Aikatsu!

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:43.540
Three, four!

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:44.800
Aikatsu!

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.710
Come on, shout louder!

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:47.550
Yes!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:48.800
Five, six!

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:50.010
Aikatsu!

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:51.050
Seven, eight!

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:52.180
Aikatsu!

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.180
Nine, ten!

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:54.430
Aikatsu!

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:56.640
Once more! One, two!

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:57.930
Aikatsu!

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:00.980
Bad! Show some guts!

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.020
I can't go on...

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:06.360
Me neither...

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:16.120
Step it up or that CD debut will a dream within a dream!

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.410
Spare us...

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:18.950
Don't give me that!

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:22.120
Come on, one last push!

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:31.260
<i>Yume...</i>

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.590
<i>Rola...</i>

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:34.970
<i>I'll never...</i>

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:37.560
<i>lose to you!</i>

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:46.190
Not bad, Yume.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:49.690
Right back at you.

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:53.910
Nice Aikatsu! Let's get right into the next lesson.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.200
What?!

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:58.450
What's next?

00:07:58.450 --> 00:07:59.950
I can still go on!

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:01.460
Okay.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:08.840
Well done, girls.

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.840
Now try taking off that equipment. You're in for a nice surprise.

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:17.600
Wait...

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:19.890
Could it be?

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:22.230
My body feels so light!

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:24.650
I feel like I can fly!

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:26.480
No, you can't.

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:27.980
Ow...

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:32.570
Your final job is to relax in the baths and get a nice massage.

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:33.490
Okay!

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.120
It feels like paradise...

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:41.120
I got dizzy...

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:43.500
All my muscles ache...

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:48.750
I was just looking for you two.

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:51.050
Yuri-senpai.

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:52.260
Good evening.

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:55.430
I've got something important to tell you about the audition.

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:12.690
So what did you want to tell us?

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:13.860
Oh, right!

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:14.860
Check this out!

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:20.370
It's the CD I got to make when I won last year!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.500
That's awesome!

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:25.040
Congratulations!

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:29.500
Today I'll give you each a very special autographed CD.

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:33.050
Thank you!

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:34.630
Thanks so much!

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:38.510
Um, do you always carry these around with you?

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:42.260
I just happened to today, okay?

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:44.520
Anyway, on to the important part.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:48.520
You know Producer Sashida from Four Star Label?

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:53.030
He may look laid back, but his ear for singers is the real deal.

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:55.030
The real deal...

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:57.780
So give it your all and don't get complacent!

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:00.070
That gets me going.

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:01.330
What does?

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:05.540
Hearing that my singing will be assessed fairly and fully.

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.040
Now that's the look of someone full of confidence.

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:13.880
It must be awesome having your own CD.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:17.510
I wonder what I should put on my CD jacket.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:27.390
Yume-chan, is something wrong?

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:29.560
No, I'm good.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:36.530
<i>Can my singing really beat out Rola's?</i>

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:47.250
<i>I'm no match for Rola right now.</i>

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:57.090
I want to win against Rola.

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:00.590
That piano...

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:12.520
Hime-senpai!

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:14.900
Oh, good morning, Yume-cha—

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:15.610
I have a request!

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:19.110
Please give me tips for getting better at singing!

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.120
This must be about the CD debut audition.

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:27.370
Yes, I was hoping you could point me in the right direction.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:33.380
Yume-chan, for what purpose do you sing?

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:37.300
W-Well I...

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:42.050
Yes, I suppose there's only one thing I can say.

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:44.890
Sing using your own power.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.140
My own?

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:52.060
Trying to power beyond your ability will tear you apart someday.

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:54.900
What exactly do you...

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:58.900
I guess I'm just trying to tell you to be yourself.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.650
<b>N{*\fax0.218}e{*\fax0.217}w {*\fax0.213}P{*\fax0.211}r{*\fax0.21}i{*\fax0.208}n{*\fax0.206}c{*\fax0.204}e{*\fax0.203}s{*\fax0.201}s {*\fax0.197}C{*\fax0.196}D {*\fax0.192}A{*\fax0.19}u{*\fax0.189}d{*\fax0.187}i{*\fax0.185}t{*\fax0.183}i{*\fax0.182}on</b>

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:04.200
Now then, let's get this audition on the road.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:04.910
Yes!

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:07.660
We'll start with the first task.

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:13.540
The strength test! Only those who can make it over this wall will pass!

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:17.040
I'm losing it!

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:19.300
I'm gonna fall!

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:29.970
My body is light as a feather!

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:32.810
These are the results of Anna-sensei's training!

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:41.570
Nothing can stop me!

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:43.610
I can climb this!

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:48.450
The summit is mine!{it's not the metaphorical view, it's the metaphorical "person who looks from the top"}

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.410
I'll take it!

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:57.710
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:01.960
You two're pretty good. 
Let's head on to the second task.

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:06.760
Aikatsu katsu-katsu three katsu-katsu.
Put together it's Aikatsu six katsu-katsu. {alright, okay, this simply makes no sense to me besides the tongue twister part. ｱｲｶﾂかつかつみかつかつ合わせて ｱｲｶﾂむかつかつ！}{something about 且つ but whatever}

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.260
Twist harder!

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:11.970
Aikatsu katsu-katsu three katsu-katsu.
Put together it's Aikatsu six katsu-katsu.

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:15.560
Aikatsu katsu-katsu-ka... I slipped up!

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:15.560
Aikatsu katsu-katsu three katsu-katsu.
Put together it's Aikatsu six katsu-katsu.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:17.690
You, you're out.

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:22.030
The Aikatsu next door eats cutlet a lot. {late at night, making nonsense up, help}

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:24.650
The Aikatsu next door eats cutlet a lot.

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:27.990
The Aikatsu next door eats cutlet a lot.

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:26.240
The next Ai...

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:27.990
Yes, you're out.

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:31.990
Aikatsu katsu-katsu three katsu-katsu.
Put together it's Aikatsu six katsu-katsu.

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:35.500
<i>Amazing, this is all thanks to Anna-sensei's training!</i>

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.750
<i>Even my tongue is limber!</i>

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:41.750
Next is your third task.

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:45.260
Show me a dress you think worthy for the audition.

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:47.260
Here's mine.

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:50.430
The Melty Flower Fairy Coord.

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:52.770
And mine.

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:55.180
The Water Race Coord.

00:13:56.020 --> 00:14:02.270
Very nice. A coord with the cuteness of a fairy and one with the refreshing flow of water.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.900
Good, you both pass.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:08.530
Next is the fourth task.

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.330
Fifth task!

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:15.080
Sixth!

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:20.250
So only Nijino Yume-chan and Sakuraba Rola-chan are left.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:25.800
The last task is a test of your singing ability before a live audience.

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:30.430
Maybe we should just have you do it together instead of separately.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.470
Together?

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.390
I don't mind.

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:35.430
Rola?

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:40.310
Yume, I want to sing the same song on the same stage with you.

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:43.820
I can't imagine a better way to face you fair and square.

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:45.820
A-All right.

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:50.570
Okay then! I'll see you on stage after a quick rest.

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:55.620
My throat's a bit dry from the nerves.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:58.330
Yeah, and I don't see any drinks here.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:01.920
I'll go buy something. 
You want something too, right?

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:03.340
Yeah, thanks.

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:07.340
<i>It's almost time.</i>

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:10.590
Really? Aren't we already set on Rola-chan?

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:13.850
Yeah, yeah, yeah, but that's not the point.

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:17.850
We've gotta at least pretend to judge them.

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:20.270
So the audition is fixed?

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.860
Don't make it sound so shady.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:28.360
It's just that Sakuraba Rola's technique is something else.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:31.110
I wouldn't hesitate to call it perfect.

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:33.780
What about Nijino Yume?

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:39.120
She's a diamond in the rough, not quite ready yet. {first, I'm sure this can be used this way. second, this might be redundant...}{one, it can't be used this way, it's "she's a diamond in the rough", not "she's like a diamond in the rough", and two, yes it is redundant}

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:57.810
As I thought. My singing right now just can't...

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:19.450
Huh? What's wrong with me?

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:24.080
Yume-chan!

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:28.800
Beauty Class lessons ended early, 
so I came to watch you.

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:32.510
Yume-chan?

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:35.050
Koharu-chan!

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:38.140
Wh-What's wrong?

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:46.360
Hey, Koharu-chan. Between me and Rola, who do you think is the better singer?

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:48.440
Yume-chan...

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:52.360
Please, give me an honest answer.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:56.740
On pure skill, I think Rola is better.

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:01.500
I see...

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:02.370
Wait!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:08.380
Yume-chan, sometimes when you're up on stage, you become completely different.

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:15.300
When that happens, you sing even better than Rola!

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.260
When that happens?

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:18.220
Nijino.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:21.100
It's time to go on.

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:21.720
Okay!

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.480
Thanks, Koharu-chan.

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:25.890
Do your best.

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:26.850
I will!

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:30.690
You're late!

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:33.110
Sorry...

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:35.780
You had me worried, seriously.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:39.280
Well, I can understand being nervous. I am too.

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:47.500
It's my time to shine!

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.920
<i>I want to win!</i>

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.750
<i>I want my own CD!</i>

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:56.430
<i>Please, let it happen again.</i>

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:58.140
<i>Just this once!</i>

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:23.880
Uh, Sashida-san?

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:24.880
This is it.

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:25.760
Huh?

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:29.390
The raw diamond that will succeed Hime-chan...

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:31.890
This year's CD debut...

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:36.230
...goes to you, Nijino Yume!

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:37.400
Hey!

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:39.480
Are we okay with this?

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:45.240
I get...

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:47.990
I get my CD debut?

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:52.120
Congratulations, Yume.

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:54.120
Thanks, Rola!

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:56.250
I did it! I really did it!

00:21:56.670 --> 00:21:58.170
That power...

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:02.000
I can no longer avert my eyes.

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:05.510
The tragedy must not come to pass again.

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:06.840
You did it!

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:07.880
Congrats!

00:22:07.880 --> 00:22:09.760
I won't lose next time!

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:12.060
Be sure to sign a CD for me!

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:14.890
Thanks, everyone!

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:20.690
Are you okay?

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:22.520
Yeah, I'm just fine.

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:02.330
Have you all visited Aikatsu Island yet?

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:07.840
You'll be able to see them perform in a pair unit.

00:24:07.840 --> 00:24:10.090
Everyone come and play!

00:24:12.300 --> 00:24:13.510
Yume-chan?

00:24:13.510 --> 00:24:15.970
The CD debut I've always dreamed of!

00:24:15.970 --> 00:24:17.970
I'll do my best!

00:24:17.970 --> 00:24:20.350
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.350 --> 00:24:22.060
The Road To Her Hero. {what, not using admiration? who is this guy? also I'm not totally happy with it}{I don't think we ever talked about title capitalization but I'm really leaning towards capitalizing every word}

00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:24.310
Become the first-star idol!
